<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves down FIM 307 million in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves down FIM 307 million in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to March 21 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to March 14:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 60,873	 61,180</p>
<p> Money market intervention    18,158	 18,158</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,907	  1,907</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,256	  2,256</p>
<p> Other				 7,054	  7,105</p>
<p> Total assets		     90,248	 90,606</p>
<p>In the previous week, to March 14, reserves fell by 994 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
